          "id": "1571",
          "question": "The diagram (which is not drawn to scale) shows a box measuring $5 \\mathrm{~cm}$ by $5 \\mathrm{~cm}$. There are seven bars in the box, each measuring $1 \\mathrm{~cm}$ by $3 \\mathrm{~cm}$. Kanga wants to slide the bars in the box so there is room for one more bar. What is the minimum number of bars that Kanga needs to move?\n\n<image1>",
