          "decoded_image": {
            "path": "images/1571.jpg",
            "original_path": "1571.jpg"
          },
          "answer": "3",
          "solution": "Label three of the bars $\\mathrm{X}, \\mathrm{Y}$ and $\\mathrm{Z}$ as shown in the diagram. At the start Kanga can only move bar X down. Now Y and $\\mathrm{Z}$ are the only bars that can be moved and Kanga must slide these bars to the left. Only now is there space for one more bar and Kanga has moved 3 bars.  ![](https://cdn.mathpix.com/cropped/2023_12_27_0f4ed2787981bb911326g-113.jpg?height=311&width=305&top_left_y=852&top_left_x=1502)",
